f8ea1ec8bc4c3.mp4?t=1495605075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li><strong>An ugly world made beautiful.</strong> The sprawling city of Greypool and its seedy residents are brought to life with stunning art and animation inspired by medieval artworks.<br></li><li><strong>An acclaimed team.</strong> Killers and Thieves was created by Alex Thomas, co-creator of the acclaimed Banner Saga series, and a team of award-winning industry professionals.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/382330/extras/d7b414c32256430f097e80f32e9815ef.avif?t=1495605075\" width=512 height=128 /></span><br>Killers and Thieves is the creation of Alex Thomas, co-founder of Stoic and Creative Director on The Banner Saga. He created this thieving adventure as an independent project, and it is being published by the Stoic team. Inspired by the question “What if you ran an entire thieves guild?” Alex has collaborated with a team of talented industry professionals to breathe life into a cruel, dangerous world.",
